title: Bed3B
---
// Talk target of his bed in 3B (Hotspots layer). Going to sleep is the bottleneck of most
// chapters: it starts the next chapter once the chapter's gates are done, and says it is
// too early before that.
-> Go to sleep <<if $chapter != "R1Viewing">>
    <<if $chapter == "R1MoveIn">>
        <<if $gate_r1_move_socks and $gate_r1_move_rules>>
            <<set $gate_r1_move_bed to true>>
            <<done R1MoveIn bed>>
            <<note_done r1_move>>
            <<next_scene Route1SundayStart>>
        <<elseif not $gate_r1_move_box>>
            You: My box is still at the bottom of the stairs. Not yet.
        <<elseif $item_blush_socks>>
            You: Not with a pair of pink socks in my hand. They need a place.
        <<else>>
            You: Someone's at my door.
        <<endif>>
    <<elseif $chapter == "R1Sunday">>
        <<if $gate_r1_sun_croissant>>
            <<set $gate_r1_sun_bed to true>>
            <<done R1Breakfast bed>>
            <<note_done r1_sun>>
            <<next_scene Route1Thu1Start>>
        <<elseif not $gate_r1_sun_text>>
            You: My phone's buzzing. Sleep can wait.
        <<else>>
            You: Her croissant first. It's getting cold.
        <<endif>>
    <<elseif $chapter == "R1Thu1">>
        <<if $gate_r1_thu1_dishes>>
            <<set $gate_r1_thu1_bed to true>>
            <<done R1Dinner1 bed>>
            <<note_done r1_thu1>>
            <<next_scene Route1Thu2Start>>
        <<else>>
            You: It's not even eight. Dinner at hers first.
        <<endif>>
    <<elseif $chapter == "R1Thu2">>
        <<if $gate_r1_thu2_night>>
            <<set $gate_r1_thu2_bed to true>>
            <<done R1Dinner2 knock>>
            <<next_scene Route1Thu2End>>
        <<elseif $gate_r1_thu2_stand>>
            You: My phone first. It's been buzzing since I got in.
        <<else>>
            You: Not yet. Tonight's at hers.
        <<endif>>
    <<endif>>
-> Put the blush socks on <<if $chapter == "R1Thu2" and not $gate_r1_thu2_door and $item_blush_socks>>
    <<set $item_blush_socks to false>>
    <<set $r1_socks_at to "feet">>
    <<done R1Dinner2 find>>
    <<done R1Dinner2 socks>>
    You: Fine. Blush.
-> Look
    <<if $chapter == "R1Viewing">>
        {$samantha_name}: This is where the bed goes. There's a mattress, but no frame. The last tenant took it. Sentimental, I suppose.
    <<else>>
        You: My bed. A mattress on the floor, made for once.
    <<endif>>
===
